YOUR RÉSUMÉ GOES HERE
=====================

This is a placeholder so the "Download résumé" link on the portfolio
page resolves instead of returning 404.

To replace it:
  1. Export your CV as PDF.
  2. Save it as  wwwroot/files/resume.pdf  (overwrite this file).
  3. Optionally change About:ResumePath / About:ResumeLabel in portfolio.json.

The same content is also provided as resume.txt for editing convenience.